/// settings and permissions to return.
///
/// ## Usage
///
/// ```dart
/// final message = TomGetSettingsMessage()
///   ..authorizationToken = 'Bearer your-jwt-token';
/// ```
///
/// See also:
/// - [TomGetSettingsResult] for the response containing settings data

